# Publishing changes back
error-push-action-key-premature = That step can't be marked as sent before the change has been sent.
error-push-all-origins-changed = Everything you were sending has changed since you looked. Review the changes and try again.
error-push-approval-failed = The approval card couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
error-push-approval-missing = This can't be sent until the approval card has been approved.
error-push-approved-version-changed = The document changed after you approved it. Review it and approve it again.
error-push-audience-grew = More people can now see this than when you approved it, so it wasn't updated. Approve it again.
error-push-branch-moved = Where this change is going has changed since you started. Refresh and try again.
error-push-confluence-unavailable = Confluence pages can't be sent back from here.
error-push-copy-cannot-bring-back = A PDF or slides copy can't be brought back into ordin.
error-push-copy-maker-failed = The copy couldn't be made. Try again.
error-push-copy-state = That can't be done to this copy in its current state.
error-push-delete-unchecked = Deleting at the destination needs your check first. Review it and confirm.
error-push-destination-refused = The destination wouldn't accept the change. Try again, or check it there.
error-push-forbidden = You don't have permission to change the original. Ask its owner for access.
error-push-format-not-ready = That copy format isn't ready yet. Try again in a moment.
error-push-git-branch-unknown = This folder doesn't say where changes should go. Choose where to send them and try again.
error-push-git-identity-missing = Your name and email for saving changes aren't set up yet. Add them and try again.
error-push-items-out-of-range = A change can hold 1 to 200 items. Add or remove items and try again.
error-push-item-already-pending = That item is already part of a change being sent.
error-push-item-not-changed = That item has no changes to send.
error-push-name-exists = A file or page with that name is already at the destination. Choose another name.
error-push-not-held = A version can only be chosen for a change that is waiting for you.
error-push-no-review-right = You can't open a review in that repository. Ask its owner for access.
error-push-original-unreadable = The original couldn't be read at the version you want to publish. Try again.
error-push-origin-changed = The original changed while you were sending. Review the latest version and try again.
error-push-origin-not-found = The original document no longer exists where it came from.
error-push-origin-unreachable = The original couldn't be reached. Check your connection and try again.
error-push-outcome-unknown = Your change may have arrived, but no answer came back. Check the destination before sending again.
error-push-request-invalid = The details of that change are missing or too long. Check them and try again.
error-push-sign-in-needed = Your sign-in for the original has expired. Sign in again and try once more.
error-push-store-failed = Your changes couldn't be stored. Try again in a moment.
error-push-summary-invalid = The summary must be 1 to 120 characters on one line. Change it and try again.
error-push-team-commit-missing = The change you prepared for the team can't be found. Prepare it again.
error-push-team-share-state = That can't be done to this team share in its current state.
error-push-team-share-unknown = That team share couldn't be found.
error-push-too-large = That file is too large for the place it is going to.
error-push-unknown = That change, item, copy or submission couldn't be found.
